flowchart TB
  Human[Caregiver and fictional patient test actor] --> UI[Companion UI and consent controls]
  subgraph APP[Application boundary]
    UI --> AI[Conversational model untrusted proposals]
    AI --> GW[Deterministic typed action gateway]
    GW --> Rec[Care record and medication services]
    Rec --> Audit[Append only audit and provenance]
    Rec --> Sum[Deterministic summary and exact preview]
    Human --> Approval[Explicit content and recipient approval]
    Sum --> Approval
    Approval --> Out[Allowlisted outbox and bounded retries]
    Out --> Mock[Approved mock receiver and telepresence]
  end
  GW -->|Named bounded skill request only| Motion[Main motion controller]
  subgraph SAFE[Independent motion safety boundary]
    EStop[Local and operator E stops] --> SC[Independent safety chain]
    Sensors[Reviewed fault and enable signals] --> SC
    SC --> Enable[Hazardous drive enable inhibit]
    Motion --> Drives[Lower body or handling drives]
    Enable --> Drives
  end
  Drives --> Mech[Structure joints feet and supported handling]
  Arrest[Power independent rated arrest and support] --> Mech
  Mech --> Shell[Removable panels and protected joint gaps]
  Sim[Simulation and digital twin no hardware credentials] --> Logs[Read only evidence and replay]
  Motion --> Logs
  SC --> Logs
  Audit --> Logs
